                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 3691717–23.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Combs to the
                            Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Extract.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Guatemala</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1907-01-16"><hi rendition="#italic">January 16,
                        1907</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 512.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to transmit herewith
                    copies of telegraphic correspondence from President Bonilla.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Leslie Combs.</hi></signed></closer>









